{
  "name": "doom3",
  "title": "DOOM 3 1.3.1 (Linux/GLX demo build, GPL source)",
  "dir": "corpus/DOOM-3/neo",
  "fetch": "git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/id-Software/DOOM-3.git corpus/DOOM-3",
  "_doc": "The Linux client as sys/scons builds it with TARGET_DEMO=1 ALSA=0 (SConstruct, SConscript.core/.idlib/.game/.gl): the demo executable, its idlib, and the game as gamex86.so with an idlib of its own. libGL is dlopened (glimp_dlopen), as the shipped client did, not hard-linked.",
  "_defines": "What every unit of the demo build gets: gcc -m32's platform macros, ID_DEMO_BUILD (BASE_GAMEDIR \"demo\") and ID_ENABLE_CURL=0 as local_demo/local_curl set them. The rest is per unit (unitDefines).",
  "defines": {
    "__linux__": "1",
    "__linux": "1",
    "linux": "1",
    "__unix__": "1",
    "ID_DEMO_BUILD": "1",
    "ID_ENABLE_CURL": "0"
  },
